description: Next.js App Router conventions for this repo.
globs: src/app/**/*.{ts,tsx},src/proxy.ts,next.config.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# App Router

- Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Mutations live in `"use server"` files (`actions.ts`) or Route Handlers under `src/app/api`.
- Import with `@/` aliases. Match existing file naming (`kebab-case.tsx`).
- Auth-aware data: `createClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/server`.
- Next 16 docs: `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — read the specific guide, not the whole tree.
